      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-08-18T09:39:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We\u0027ll indeed just need to create a public interface to down the CPU to a certain level. (e.g. cpu_{down,remove}(cpu, target) where target \u003d CPUHP_AP_LIMIT).\n\nI have a new version of this patch-set, I should be able to share soon, which will incorporate a usage example.",
      "parentUuid": "75262489_65d38f2c",
